#   l "When I began to play Eternum there was one I liked to visit a lot. It had an old barn where I liked to hide."
    l "Quando comecei a jogar Eternum havia um que eu gostava muito de visitar. Tinha um velho celeiro onde eu gostava de me esconder."

# game/script7.rpy:1922
