    bet "Eles têm muitas necessidades."

# game/script7.rpy:3788
translate brazil werewolveslabel_933afe7a:

#   bur "But I'll take good care of her!"
    bur "Mas vou cuidar bem dela!"

# game/script7.rpy:3789
translate brazil werewolveslabel_7d8dee6c:

#   bur "I'll hunt food for her and take her for walks every day!"
    bur "Vou caçar comida para ela e levá-la para passear todos os dias!"

# game/script7.rpy:3791
translate brazil werewolveslabel_b6e4ff2d:

#   bet "I said no, Burpee."
    bet "Eu disse não, Burpee."

# game/script7.rpy:3793
translate brazil werewolveslabel_f8d83125:

#   bur "Awwwhh..." with dis12
    bur "Ahhhh..." with dis12

# game/script7.rpy:3794
translate brazil werewolveslabel_34fba7ec:

#   bur "I'm sorry, Luna."
    bur "Sinto muito, Lua."

# game/script7.rpy:3796
translate brazil werewolveslabel_37749560:

#   l "No worries, Burpee!"
    l "Não se preocupe, Burpee!"

# game/script7.rpy:3797
translate brazil werewolveslabel_89333c33:

#   l "We can be friends anyway!"
    l "Podemos ser amigos de qualquer maneira!"

# game/script7.rpy:3799
translate brazil werewolveslabel_428d69de:

#   larry "*Cheeky laugh* Looks like someone's wife has him on a tight leash."
    larry "*Risada atrevida* Parece que a esposa de alguém o tem sob controle."

# game/script7.rpy:3803
translate brazil werewolveslabel_166d9eda:

#   bur "I heard that, Larry!" with hpunch
    bur "Eu ouvi isso, Larry!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:3806
translate brazil werewolveslabel_bbbf7714:

#   nimbus "*Sniffing* Ugh, what's that smell...?"
    nimbus "*Cheirando* Ugh, que cheiro é esse...?"

# game/script7.rpy:3808
translate brazil werewolveslabel_3ce082e8:

#   larry "Oh god, not Tissle again..."
    larry "Oh Deus, Tissle não de novo..."

# game/script7.rpy:3810
translate brazil werewolveslabel_49b831c7:

#   wiggle "Oh, COME ON, guys!"
    wiggle "Ah, vamos lá, pessoal!"

# game/script7.rpy:3811
translate brazil werewolveslabel_5aff0bfd:

#   wiggle "I don't smell anymore!"
    wiggle "Eu não sinto mais cheiro!"

# game/script7.rpy:3813
translate brazil werewolveslabel_5b591b9e:

#   bur "You're stinking up the place with your skunk stench, Tis!"
    bur "Você está fedendo o lugar com seu fedor de gambá, Tis!"

# game/script7.rpy:3814
translate brazil werewolveslabel_6c224f93:

#   bur "Go back to the river and get washed again!"
    bur "Volte para o rio e lave-se novamente!"

# game/script7.rpy:3816
translate brazil werewolveslabel_aa943fa3:

#   wiggle "But the water is so cold!"
    wiggle "Mas a água está tão fria!"

# game/script7.rpy:3818
translate brazil werewolveslabel_35fd5636:

#   larry "He does have a point, that water is freezing."
    larry "Ele tem razão: a água está congelando."

# game/script7.rpy:3820
translate brazil werewolveslabel_80ee0750:

#   nimbus "Yeah, one of the drawbacks of having short fur."
    nimbus "Sim, uma das desvantagens de ter pêlo curto."

# game/script7.rpy:3822
translate brazil werewolveslabel_eafe0a49:

#   larry "Well, our northern cousins have long fur everywhere, but they get roasted during summer."
    larry "Bem, nossos primos do norte têm pelos longos em todos os lugares, mas ficam tostados durante o verão."

# game/script7.rpy:3823
translate brazil werewolveslabel_594068a5:

#   larry "I don't know what's worse."
    larry "Não sei o que é pior."

# game/script7.rpy:3825
translate brazil werewolveslabel_935b6bc1:

#   nimbus "But they look cooler, like... actual wolves."
    nimbus "Mas eles parecem mais legais, como... lobos de verdade."

# game/script7.rpy:3826
translate brazil werewolveslabel_a0a0854f:

#   nimbus "We could pass as oversized Dobermans."
    nimbus "Poderíamos passar por Dobermans enormes."

# game/script7.rpy:3828
translate brazil werewolveslabel_3a5e4b8a:

#   larry "I prefer to say we look like descendants of Anubis."
    larry "Prefiro dizer que parecemos descendentes de Anúbis."

# game/script7.rpy:3829
translate brazil werewolveslabel_6ce77c0e:

#   mct "Anubis...?"
    mct "Anúbis...?"

# game/script7.rpy:3831
translate brazil werewolveslabel_5b341572:

#   nimbus "What the fuck is an anubis?"
    nimbus "Que porra é um anúbis?"

# game/script7.rpy:3833
translate brazil werewolveslabel_27175291:

#   larry "The Egyptian deity, hello?"
    larry "A divindade egípcia, olá?"

# game/script7.rpy:3835
translate brazil werewolveslabel_31d09a57:

#   nimbus "The what now?"
    nimbus "O que agora?"

# game/script7.rpy:3837
translate brazil werewolveslabel_5c01191e:

#   bur "Yeah, stop making things up, Larry."
    bur "Sim, pare de inventar coisas, Larry."

# game/script7.rpy:3839
translate brazil werewolveslabel_f9437d39:

#   larry "I'm not making anything up, you bunch of illiterates!"
    larry "Não estou inventando nada, seu bando de analfabetos!"

# game/script7.rpy:3840
translate brazil werewolveslabel_abf1791d:

#   larry "Ask the pretty girl!"
    larry "Pergunte à linda garota!"

# game/script7.rpy:3842
translate brazil werewolveslabel_ce6e51ce:

#   l "He's actually right!"
    l "Ele está realmente certo!"

# game/script7.rpy:3843
translate brazil werewolveslabel_cde73802:

#   l "And I agree, you remind me of–"
    l "E eu concordo, você me lembra de–"

# game/script7.rpy:3848
translate brazil werewolveslabel_05bf6064:

#   fan "{sc=2}*Roars*{/sc}" with hpunchlong6
    fan "{sc=2}*Rugidos*{/sc}" with hpunchlong6

# game/script7.rpy:3851
translate brazil werewolveslabel_f6051023:

#   fan "WHAT ARE YOU ALL DOING HERE?!" with hpunch
    fan "O QUE VOCÊS ESTÃO FAZENDO AQUI?!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:3852
translate brazil werewolveslabel_f613a1bd:

#   fan "STOP SLACKING OFF AND GET BACK TO YOUR POSTS!" with hpunch
    fan "Pare de relaxar e volte para suas postagens!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:3853
translate brazil werewolveslabel_96538158:

#   fan "NOW!" with hpunch
    fan "AGORA!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:3856
translate brazil werewolveslabel_56518520:

#   bla "The entire pack swiftly disengages, obediently following their leader's commands as they sprint out of the chamber." with dis2
    bla "A matilha inteira se desvencilha rapidamente, seguindo obedientemente os comandos de seu líder enquanto correm para fora da câmara." with dis2

# game/script7.rpy:3860
translate brazil werewolveslabel_0af209b9:

#   bla "Despite bearing the same appearance as his kin, Fangrend stands before you enveloped in an aura that renders him particularly daunting." with dis14
    bla "Apesar de ter a mesma aparência de seus parentes, Fangrend está diante de você envolto em uma aura que o torna particularmente assustador." with dis14

# game/script7.rpy:3863
translate brazil werewolveslabel_e41e687c:

#   fan "Duke...? Burpee?"
    fan "Duque...? Burpee?"

# game/script7.rpy:3864
translate brazil werewolveslabel_576aeb28:

#   fan "You let hunters into our sanctuary?"
    fan "Você deixou caçadores entrarem em nosso santuário?"

# game/script7.rpy:3866
translate brazil werewolveslabel_848ad6e2:

#   bur "W-What do you mean h-hunters...?"
    bur "O-O que você quer dizer com h-caçadores...?"

# game/script7.rpy:3867
translate brazil werewolveslabel_58cbea22:

#   bur "Y-You're hunters?"
    bur "V-Vocês são caçadores?"

# game/script7.rpy:3869
translate brazil werewolveslabel_0dd1cbef:

#   mc "We're not!"
    mc "Nós não estamos!"

# game/script7.rpy:3870
translate brazil werewolveslabel_13f31251:

#   mc "We just–"
    mc "Nós apenas–"

# game/script7.rpy:3872
translate brazil werewolveslabel_4417e93b:

#   fan "LIES!" with hpunch
    fan "MENTIRAS!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:3873
translate brazil werewolveslabel_aa956d51:

#   fan "You're dressed in their garb!"
    fan "Você está vestido com o traje deles!"

# game/script7.rpy:3875
translate brazil werewolveslabel_2c1400b6:

#   mc "But we're not! It's all a ruse!"
    mc "Mas não estamos! É tudo um estratagema!"

# game/script7.rpy:3876
translate brazil werewolveslabel_f8987355:

#   mc "We just came to these lands to investigate something, that's all!"
    mc "Viemos a estas terras apenas para investigar uma coisa, só isso!"

# game/script7.rpy:3878
translate brazil werewolveslabel_9c1c4b69:

#   fan "Do you know how many of us have fallen to those murderers since the hunt began?"
    fan "Você sabe quantos de nós caímos nas mãos desses assassinos desde que a caçada começou?"

# game/script7.rpy:3880
translate brazil werewolveslabel_5a1088d6:

#   mc "We're not a part of it, I swear."
    mc "Não fazemos parte disso, eu juro."

# game/script7.rpy:3881
translate brazil werewolveslabel_a921a868:

#   fan ". . ."
    fan ". . ."

# game/script7.rpy:3882
translate brazil werewolveslabel_89a52ec4:

#   fan "Hmph."
    fan "Hmph."

# game/script7.rpy:3884
translate brazil werewolveslabel_862d0fdc:

#   fan "I can hear your pulses, and they don’t indicate lies... so I'll let you live today."
    fan "Posso ouvir seus pulsos, e eles não indicam mentiras... então vou deixar você viver hoje."

# game/script7.rpy:3885
translate brazil werewolveslabel_6b70b39b:

#   fan "Leave, and never come back."
    fan "Vá embora e nunca mais volte."

# game/script7.rpy:3887
translate brazil werewolveslabel_9869fa4d:

#   mc "Wait! I was hoping I could ask you a few questions before–"
    mc "Espere! Eu esperava poder fazer algumas perguntas antes-"

# game/script7.rpy:3889
translate brazil werewolveslabel_099e20b8:

#   fan "I have nothing to discuss with a human from outside our pack."
    fan "Não tenho nada para discutir com um humano de fora da nossa matilha."

# game/script7.rpy:3891
translate brazil werewolveslabel_efd3ef0b:

#   mc "We don't have to be enemies."
    mc "Não precisamos ser inimigos."

# game/script7.rpy:3893
translate brazil werewolveslabel_29c9885a:

#   fan "You're not even worthy to be here."
    fan "Você nem é digno de estar aqui."

# game/script7.rpy:3895
translate brazil werewolveslabel_49998ebc:

#   mc "Then let me prove you my worth!"
    mc "Então deixe-me provar meu valor!"

# game/script7.rpy:3897
translate brazil werewolveslabel_59bbae1f:

#   fan "You?"
    fan "Você?"

# game/script7.rpy:3898
translate brazil werewolveslabel_a30dc41c:

#   fan "You're nothing but a frail human."
    fan "Você não passa de um humano frágil."

# game/script7.rpy:3900
translate brazil werewolveslabel_1293825d:

#   mc "I am not weak."
    mc "Eu não sou fraco."

# game/script7.rpy:3902
translate brazil werewolveslabel_5c994c3f:

#   fan "Hah."
    fan "Hah."

# game/script7.rpy:3903
translate brazil werewolveslabel_75de8dec:

#   fan "Overconfidence can be a dangerous quality, young man."
    fan "O excesso de confiança pode ser uma qualidade perigosa, meu jovem."

# game/script7.rpy:3904
translate brazil werewolveslabel_75595b4e:

#   fan "Do you really think you could best me in a duel?"
    fan "Você realmente acha que poderia me vencer em um duelo?"

# game/script7.rpy:3906
translate brazil werewolveslabel_c6e878ec:

#   mc "I could."
    mc "Eu pudesse."

# game/script7.rpy:3908
translate brazil werewolveslabel_a038927d:

#   fan "Hah..."
    fan "Hah..."

# game/script7.rpy:3909
translate brazil werewolveslabel_2c6bb7fa:

#   fan "Alright then."
    fan "Tudo bem então."

# game/script7.rpy:3910
translate brazil werewolveslabel_b57c2979:

#   fan "Prove your mettle."
    fan "Prove sua coragem."

# game/script7.rpy:3911
translate brazil werewolveslabel_d909c7fa:

#   fan "Defeat me in combat... and I'll address all of your questions."
    fan "Derrote-me em combate... e responderei a todas as suas perguntas."

# game/script7.rpy:3912
translate brazil werewolveslabel_7a577620:

#   fan "You and me, in my human form. Even odds."
    fan "Você e eu, em minha forma humana. Até probabilidades."

# game/script7.rpy:3914
translate brazil werewolveslabel_ab1bb158:

#   mct "A duel?"
    mct "Para duelar?"

# game/script7.rpy:3919
translate brazil werewolveslabel_84c87fab:

#   mc "I was thinking of fighting you in your wolf form." with dis06
    mc "Eu estava pensando em lutar com você em sua forma de lobo." with dis06

# game/script7.rpy:3921
translate brazil werewolveslabel_0ff5460b:

#   mc "We have better things to do than unnecessary fights." with dis06
    mc "Temos coisas melhores para fazer do que brigas desnecessárias." with dis06

# game/script7.rpy:3923
translate brazil werewolveslabel_d60740b1:

#   fan "Hah. So I thought."
    fan "Hah. Então pensei."

# game/script7.rpy:3925
translate brazil werewolveslabel_f2d69467:

#   fan "Now go, and never come back."
    fan "Agora vá e nunca mais volte."

# game/script7.rpy:3926
translate brazil werewolveslabel_4f6db9a5:

#   fan "Take them to the exit, Duke."
    fan "Leve-os para a saída, Duke."

# game/script7.rpy:3928
translate brazil werewolveslabel_00c90e88:

#   mc "Rest assured, we won't come back."
    mc "Fique tranquilo, não vamos voltar."

# game/script7.rpy:3930
translate brazil werewolveslabel_ae994ca3:

#   l "Goodbye, Burpee!"
    l "Adeus, Burpee!"

# game/script7.rpy:3932
translate brazil werewolveslabel_40974da2:

#   bur "B-Bye Luna."
    bur "B-Tchau Luna."

# game/script7.rpy:3933
translate brazil werewolveslabel_5bc4a0f7:

#   bur "I'm sorry things turned out this way."
    bur "Lamento que as coisas tenham acontecido assim."

# game/script7.rpy:3935
translate brazil werewolveslabel_4a432819:

#   l "No worries!"
    l "Sem problemas!"

# game/script7.rpy:3936
translate brazil werewolveslabel_b6fbabfe:

#   l "I'm sure we'll cross paths again."
    l "Tenho certeza que nos cruzaremos novamente."

# game/script7.rpy:3938
translate brazil werewolveslabel_1cc72086:

#   bur "That would be nice! You can visit us outside the camp anytime!" with hpunch
    bur "Isso seria legal! Você pode nos visitar fora do acampamento a qualquer hora!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:3940
translate brazil werewolveslabel_6916be09:

#   l "Will do!"
    l "Vai fazer!"

# game/script7.rpy:3941
translate brazil werewolveslabel_5a7616c9:

#   l "Take care, guys!"
    l "Tome cuidado, pessoal!"

# game/script7.rpy:3944
translate brazil werewolveslabel_429e7c9d:

#   mc "In your human one? Even easier."
    mc "No seu humano? Ainda mais fácil."

# game/script7.rpy:3946
translate brazil werewolveslabel_db1cf16b:

#   fan "Hahahah..."
    fan "Hahahah..."

# game/script7.rpy:3947
translate brazil werewolveslabel_388804ac:

#   fan "I like you, boy."
    fan "Eu gosto de você, garoto."

# game/script7.rpy:3955
translate brazil werewolveslabel_8840d705:

#   fan "Hmmmmgh..." with dis12
    fan "Hummm..." with dis12

# game/script7.rpy:3959
translate brazil werewolveslabel_436c7eab:

#   fan "*Standing up* Oooh boy, that felt good." with dis15
    fan "*Levantando-se* Oooh cara, isso foi bom." with dis15

# game/script7.rpy:3962
translate brazil werewolveslabel_65060771:

#   fan "*Cracking his neck* It's been a while since I reverted to my human form." with dis
    fan "*Quebrando o pescoço* Já faz um tempo desde que voltei à minha forma humana." with dis

# game/script7.rpy:3965
translate brazil werewolveslabel_85729e9c:

#   fan "*Cracking his neck* I almost forgot how refreshing it used to feel." with dis
    fan "*Estalando o pescoço* Quase esqueci como era refrescante." with dis

# game/script7.rpy:3967
translate brazil werewolveslabel_e473df4a:

#   mc "Well..." with dis
    mc "Bem..." with dis

# game/script7.rpy:3968
translate brazil werewolveslabel_3f0c5713:

#   mct "Is he really not gonna cover himself...?"
    mct "Ele realmente não vai se cobrir...?"

# game/script7.rpy:3969
translate brazil werewolveslabel_6ffaa418:

#   mc "*Clears throat* It's good to finally be able to talk face-to-face."
    mc "*Limpa a garganta* É bom finalmente poder conversar cara a cara."

# game/script7.rpy:3970
translate brazil werewolveslabel_59fdb7ab:

#   mc "Can all of you shift into your human forms at will?"
    mc "Todos vocês podem mudar para suas formas humanas à vontade?"

# game/script7.rpy:3972
translate brazil werewolveslabel_1728a08f:

#   fan "You won't get any answers from me unless you defeat me in combat."
    fan "Você não obterá nenhuma resposta minha a menos que me derrote em combate."

# game/script7.rpy:3974
translate brazil werewolveslabel_7c30e5ec:

#   mc "Hmm. Okay then, I'm ready whenever you are."
    mc "Hum. Ok então, estou pronto quando você estiver."

# game/script7.rpy:3975
translate brazil werewolveslabel_3a7899f1:

#   mc "We're actually in a rush, so let's get this done quickly."
    mc "Na verdade, estamos com pressa, então vamos fazer isso rapidamente."

# game/script7.rpy:3977
translate brazil werewolveslabel_8eb7c4da:

#   fan "Excellent. Disrobe and meet me in the main courtyard."
    fan "Excelente. Tire a roupa e me encontre no pátio principal."

# game/script7.rpy:3978
translate brazil werewolveslabel_177d7860:

#   fan "We shall fight there."
    fan "Lutaremos lá."

# game/script7.rpy:3981
translate brazil werewolveslabel_8e413c53:

#   mc "I'm sorry, do we have to fight... naked? Me too?"
    mc "Me desculpe, temos que lutar... nus? Eu também?"

# game/script7.rpy:3982
translate brazil werewolveslabel_febe2c11:

#   fan "Mm-hm."
    fan "Hum-hm."

# game/script7.rpy:3983
translate brazil werewolveslabel_d5d4bb1b:

#   mc "I-I'm not sure I'm entirely comfortable with that."
    mc "E-eu não tenho certeza se estou totalmente confortável com isso."

# game/script7.rpy:3985
translate brazil werewolveslabel_ef7164bf:

#   fan "Why not?" with dis
    fan "Por que não?" with dis

# game/script7.rpy:3986
translate brazil werewolveslabel_16d898f6:

#   fan "Clothes are nothing but an unnecessary hindrance in battle, imposed on us by those who are blind to the natural beauty of the beast!"
    fan "As roupas nada mais são do que um obstáculo desnecessário na batalha, imposto a nós por aqueles que estão cegos para a beleza natural da fera!"

# game/script7.rpy:3987
translate brazil werewolveslabel_06db2af1:

#   fan "The art of combat should always be practiced by warriors adorned as they came into this world. In contact and one with nature!"
    fan "A arte do combate deve ser sempre praticada por guerreiros adornados à medida que vieram a este mundo. Em contato e em harmonia com a natureza!"

# game/script7.rpy:3989
translate brazil werewolveslabel_de9d540f:

#   fan "Well... that is, if your woman is okay with it, of course." with dis
    fan "Bem... isto é, se a sua mulher concordar com isso, é claro." with dis

# game/script7.rpy:3990
translate brazil werewolveslabel_0e952418:

#   fan "We can make adjustments if she's not comfortable with it. I've gotta respect that."
    fan "Podemos fazer ajustes se ela não se sentir confortável com isso. Eu tenho que respeitar isso."

# game/script7.rpy:3991
translate brazil werewolveslabel_f0c1eb1f:

#   mct "Oh, thank god."
    mct "Ah, graças a Deus."

# game/script7.rpy:3994
translate brazil werewolveslabel_5ee004bd:

#   l "Nah, it's perfectly fine. Go on and strip."
    l "Não, está perfeitamente bem. Vá em frente e tire a roupa."

# game/script7.rpy:3996
translate brazil werewolveslabel_54d621ce:

#   l "Don't worry, I couldn't care less."
    l "Não se preocupe, eu não poderia me importar menos."

# game/script7.rpy:3998
translate brazil werewolveslabel_57aa99f3:

#   mc "LUNA?! Y-YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO SAY NO!" with hpunch
    mc "LUA?! VOCÊ DEVE DIZER NÃO!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:4000
translate brazil werewolveslabel_c368bebc:

#   fan "Excellent then."
    fan "Excelente então."

# game/script7.rpy:4001
translate brazil werewolveslabel_3d5a5343:

#   fan "Let us shed this wretched garb and commence battle."
    fan "Deixemos de lado esse traje miserável e comecemos a batalha."

# game/script7.rpy:4004
translate brazil werewolveslabel_a3522b2a:

#   mc "*Sighs* I guess I have no other option."
    mc "*Suspiros* Acho que não tenho outra opção."

# game/script7.rpy:4005
translate brazil werewolveslabel_23cbf4fa:

#   mct "Ending my Eternum session with a Gachimuchi brawl... I definitely didn't see that one coming."
    mct "Terminando minha sessão de Eternum com uma briga de Gachimuchi... Eu definitivamente não esperava isso."

# game/script7.rpy:4009
translate brazil werewolveslabel_97c26e93:

#   mc "*Getting rid of your hunter robes* Okay, fuck it." with dis15
    mc "*Livrando-se de suas vestes de caçador* Ok, foda-se." with dis15

# game/script7.rpy:4010
translate brazil werewolveslabel_f460a84c:

#   mc "Happy now?"
    mc "Feliz agora?"

# game/script7.rpy:4012
translate brazil werewolveslabel_c1347cca:

#   fan "I will explain the rules."
    fan "Vou explicar as regras."

