#   mc "*Getting away from him* W-WHAT THE..." with hpunch
    mc "*Ficando longe dele* O QUE..." with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:4454
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_b4a5f924:

#   mct "What the hell... I only looked away for a second!"
    mct "Que diabos... só desviei o olhar por um segundo!"

# game/script7.rpy:4455
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_2f5b0e3c:

#   mct "How did he move so fast?!"
    mct "Como ele se moveu tão rápido?!"

# game/script7.rpy:4456
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_5466c681:

#   mct "I didn't even sense his presence until he touched my shoulder..."
    mct "Eu nem senti sua presença até que ele tocou meu ombro..."

# game/script7.rpy:4457
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_c8615cd7:

#   mc "A-And what do you mean I passed the test?!"
    mc "A-E como assim passei no teste?!"

# game/script7.rpy:4461
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_f4b7759e:

#   fan "You were willing to face me, that was the first step." with dis12
    fan "Você estava disposto a me enfrentar, esse foi o primeiro passo." with dis12

# game/script7.rpy:4462
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_baee6a63:

#   fan "Yet, you refused to fight if it meant risking the loss of one of your own."
    fan "No entanto, você se recusou a lutar se isso significasse arriscar a perda de um dos seus."

# game/script7.rpy:4463
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_a0f7ea1f:

#   fan "The pack and the individual are one. The well-being of our people must always be our ultimate priority."
    fan "A matilha e o indivíduo são um só. O bem-estar do nosso povo deve ser sempre a nossa prioridade máxima."

# game/script7.rpy:4464
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_fe4627fc:

#   fan "Always."
    fan "Sempre."

# game/script7.rpy:4466
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_161ec7b3:

#   mc "Huh... very sneaky." with dis
    mc "Huh... muito sorrateiro." with dis

# game/script7.rpy:4468
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_66cc3403:

#   fan "Welcome to the pack, [mc]."
    fan "Bem vindo ao bando, [mc]."

# game/script7.rpy:4470
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_c28ecfea:

#   mc "Um... thank you."
    mc "Hum... obrigado."

# game/script7.rpy:4471
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_00ea2570:

#   mc "I'm... honored."
    mc "Estou... honrado."

# game/script7.rpy:4472
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_322da486:

#   mct "To be honest, he never gave me a bad feeling. I'm relieved to see he's a good man and I don't have to actually fight him."
    mct "Para ser honesto, ele nunca me deu um mau pressentimento. Estou aliviado em ver que ele é um bom homem e não preciso lutar com ele."

# game/script7.rpy:4474
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_e4770e05:

#   fan "We've all wasted enough of your time, so you're free to go now."
    fan "Todos nós já perdemos muito do seu tempo, então você está livre para ir agora."

# game/script7.rpy:4475
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_baa920fe:

#   fan "Although you mentioned you had questions earlier, so feel free to ask before you leave."
    fan "Embora você tenha mencionado que tinha dúvidas anteriormente, sinta-se à vontade para perguntar antes de sair."

# game/script7.rpy:4477
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_cf7944b1:

#   mc "I appreciate it."
    mc "Eu agradeço."

# game/script7.rpy:4478
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_851a12e9:

#   mct "Mmm, I should get straight to the point."
    mct "Mmm, eu deveria ir direto ao ponto."

# game/script7.rpy:4479
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_553a3bd3:

#   mct "Penny must be already waiting for us."
    mct "Penny já deve estar esperando por nós."

# game/script7.rpy:4480
translate brazil ufheyfeyufherff_84f16542:

#   mc "Okay..."
    mc "OK..."

# game/script7.rpy:4483
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_231ddaf4:

#   mc "Well, I'd love to stay and continue asking you questions, but we really must be on our way now."
    mc "Bem, eu adoraria ficar e continuar fazendo perguntas, mas realmente precisamos ir agora."

# game/script7.rpy:4489
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_68577f56:

#   mc "You mentioned we're considered members of the pack now." with dis06
    mc "Você mencionou que agora somos considerados membros do bando." with dis06

# game/script7.rpy:4490
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_2eab73bf:

#   mc "Does that mean that... we can become werewolves?"
    mc "Isso significa que... podemos nos tornar lobisomens?"

# game/script7.rpy:4492
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_8cea3a20:

#   fan "Becoming a werewolf is a grueling, painful process, and I wouldn't recommend it to anyone." with dis
    fan "Tornar-se um lobisomem é um processo cansativo e doloroso, e eu não recomendaria isso a ninguém." with dis

# game/script7.rpy:4493
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_00b31563:

#   fan "You see, we were originally created as weapons for combat, a long time ago."
    fan "Veja, fomos originalmente criados como armas de combate, há muito tempo."

# game/script7.rpy:4494
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_530e2de1:

#   fan "We were treated like animals for so long that most of us have forgotten how to shift back into our human forms."
    fan "Fomos tratados como animais por tanto tempo que a maioria de nós esqueceu como voltar à nossa forma humana."

# game/script7.rpy:4495
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_ea4282cf:

#   fan "I'm one of the few remaining who can switch at will."
    fan "Sou um dos poucos restantes que podem mudar à vontade."

# game/script7.rpy:4496
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_87d73698:

#   fan "The rest of the pack, including Burpee and Duke, are bound to their wolf forms until I can find a way to reverse the curse."
    fan "O resto da matilha, incluindo Burpee e Duke, estão vinculados às suas formas de lobo até que eu encontre uma maneira de reverter a maldição."

# game/script7.rpy:4498
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_81f79f6a:

#   mc "Damn, that's not quite the fantastical picture I had in my mind." with dis
    mc "Droga, essa não é exatamente a imagem fantástica que eu tinha em mente." with dis

# game/script7.rpy:4499
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_a50579e0:

#   mc "I truly hope you can find a cure one day."
    mc "Eu realmente espero que você possa encontrar uma cura um dia."

# game/script7.rpy:4503
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_2c656abd:

#   mc "What memories do you have of your past?" with dis06
    mc "Que lembranças você tem do seu passado?" with dis06

# game/script7.rpy:4504
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_e13f3cfc:

#   mc "Before arriving here."
    mc "Antes de chegar aqui."

# game/script7.rpy:4506
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_a000948c:

#   fan "We all come from the northern regions of Ekabar."
    fan "Todos viemos das regiões do norte de Ekabar."

# game/script7.rpy:4507
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_0cfb6e5f:

#   fan "I've spent the last few years traveling across the continent in hopes of finding a cure."
    fan "Passei os últimos anos viajando pelo continente na esperança de encontrar uma cura."

# game/script7.rpy:4509
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_f28dd1a8:

#   mc "And what about... Egypt?"
    mc "E quanto ao... Egito?"

# game/script7.rpy:4510
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_0d93d101:

#   mc "One of your brothers mentioned it earlier."
    mc "Um de seus irmãos mencionou isso antes."

# game/script7.rpy:4511
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_1ae1c660:

#   mc "He even spoke of one of their gods."
    mc "Ele até falou de um de seus deuses."

# game/script7.rpy:4513
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_e921654d:

#   fan "Egypt...?" with dis
    fan "Egito...?" with dis

# game/script7.rpy:4514
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_6474f76a:

#   fan "Um... I'm afraid I've never come across that name... I think."
    fan "Hum... infelizmente nunca encontrei esse nome... eu acho."

# game/script7.rpy:4516
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_b5fec0ae:

#   mc "Do you know what “Eternum” is? Or Ulysses? Or things like... Europe, Asia, or America?"
    mc "Você sabe o que é \"Eterno\"? Ou Ulisses? Ou coisas como... Europa, Ásia ou América?"

# game/script7.rpy:4518
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_c3fd0dec:

#   fan "Uh... no, those terms don't ring a bell."
    fan "Uh... não, esses termos não me lembram nada."

# game/script7.rpy:4519
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_3643341a:

#   fan "Despite covering thousands of kilometers in our travels, Ekabar is all we've known."
    fan "Apesar de percorrermos milhares de quilómetros nas nossas viagens, Ekabar é tudo o que conhecemos."

# game/script7.rpy:4520
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_61c43d52:

#   fan "We have no idea of what lies beyond the great seas, I'm sorry."
    fan "Não temos ideia do que existe além dos grandes mares, sinto muito."

# game/script7.rpy:4522
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_acbb6858:

#   mc "No worries..." with dis
    mc "Sem problemas..." with dis

# game/script7.rpy:4523
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_375780f9:

#   mct "One of the werewolves mentioned Egypt and Anubis. I heard it."
    mct "Um dos lobisomens mencionou o Egito e Anúbis. Eu ouvi isso."

# game/script7.rpy:4524
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_b77856c9:

#   mct "Could their actual memories from the real world be merging with the fabricated ones they acquired when they became NPCs?"
    mct "Será que suas memórias reais do mundo real poderiam estar se fundindo com as fabricadas que adquiriram quando se tornaram NPCs?"

# game/script7.rpy:4525
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_816466e5:

#   mct "Perhaps that's the trigger that can “free” them from Ulysses' control? I’ll have to note that for later..."
    mct "Talvez seja esse o gatilho que pode “libertá-los” do controle de Ulisses? Vou ter que anotar isso para mais tarde..."

# game/script7.rpy:4529
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_7d2b3208:

#   mc "What's your current relationship with the town of Hollowbrook?" with dis06
    mc "Qual é o seu relacionamento atual com a cidade de Hollowbrook?" with dis06

# game/script7.rpy:4531
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_01f5ceba:

#   fan "If you've been there recently, you'll probably notice that it's... become strained." with dis
    fan "Se você esteve lá recentemente, provavelmente notará que... ficou tenso." with dis

# game/script7.rpy:4532
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_cbc4562b:

#   fan "Their hunters began targeting us without any provocation when we sought medicine from them."
    fan "Seus caçadores começaram a nos atacar sem qualquer provocação quando buscamos remédios deles."

# game/script7.rpy:4533
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_4bcf9680:

#   fan "We've been doing our best to steer clear of them, but if they encroach on our hideout... we'll defend ourselves."
    fan "Temos feito o possível para ficar longe deles, mas se eles invadirem nosso esconderijo... nos defenderemos."

# game/script7.rpy:4534
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_c1f36193:

#   fan "We're planning to relocate again in a few days, so hopefully it won't come to that."
    fan "Estamos planejando nos mudar novamente em alguns dias, então esperamos que não chegue a esse ponto."

# game/script7.rpy:4536
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_9f77a036:

#   mc "Understandable." with dis
    mc "Compreensível." with dis

# game/script7.rpy:4537
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_f32699d8:

#   mct "I wonder what triggered this sudden shift in behavior among the NPCs."
    mct "Eu me pergunto o que desencadeou essa mudança repentina de comportamento entre os NPCs."

# game/script7.rpy:4538
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_ea9f782b:

#   mct "Did the hunters go rogue first?"
    mct "Os caçadores se rebelaram primeiro?"

# game/script7.rpy:4539
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_ace3f6bb:

#   mct "Or perhaps it was the werewolves? They're clearly not following any prescribed path anymore."
    mct "Ou talvez fossem os lobisomens? Eles claramente não estão mais seguindo nenhum caminho prescrito."

# game/script7.rpy:4540
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_b3494483:

#   mct "Hmmm..."
    mct "Hmmm..."

# game/script7.rpy:4543
translate brazil menuwerewolfquestions_7c9012e6:

#   mc "Well, I'd love to stay and continue asking you questions, but we really must be on our way now." with dis08
    mc "Bem, eu adoraria ficar e continuar fazendo perguntas, mas realmente precisamos ir agora." with dis08

# game/script7.rpy:4545
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_69121cbd:

#   mc "I hope we can continue our conversation sometime."
    mc "Espero que possamos continuar nossa conversa algum dia."

# game/script7.rpy:4547
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_3d2ea5fd:

#   fan "Very well."
    fan "Muito bem."

# game/script7.rpy:4548
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_9bb93155:

#   fan "It was a pleasure meeting you, [mc] and Luna."
    fan "Foi um prazer conhecer vocês, [mc] e Luna."

# game/script7.rpy:4549
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_4457d6f8:

#   fan "I also hope we have the chance to meet again in the future."
    fan "Também espero que tenhamos a oportunidade de nos encontrar novamente no futuro."

# game/script7.rpy:4551
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_40d884b2:

#   mc "Oh, before we leave..."
    mc "Ah, antes de partirmos..."

# game/script7.rpy:4555
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_e4c4f2df:

#   mc "You should know that, if you truly wish to cure your brothers, Hollowbrook is your best bet." with dis06
    mc "Você deveria saber que, se realmente deseja curar seus irmãos, Hollowbrook é sua melhor aposta." with dis06

# game/script7.rpy:4556
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_90641af7:

#   mc "We crossed paths with the hunters upon our arrival, and they were leaving the town for good."
    mc "Cruzamos o caminho dos caçadores quando chegamos, e eles estavam deixando a cidade para sempre."

# game/script7.rpy:4557
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_f6ed2fa6:

#   mc "Now only a handful of civilians remain, and among them there's a shaman. Perhaps she knows how to help them return to their human form."
    mc "Agora restam apenas alguns civis, e entre eles há um xamã. Talvez ela saiba como ajudá-los a retornar à forma humana."

# game/script7.rpy:4559
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_9d68748c:

#   fan "Oh... really? That's excellent news indeed."
    fan "Oh sério? Isso é realmente uma excelente notícia."

# game/script7.rpy:4560
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_51ec29bc:

#   fan "I'll send someone to pay them a visit soon, then."
    fan "Enviarei alguém para visitá-los em breve, então."

# game/script7.rpy:4562
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_a6b7d16d:

#   mct "Hopefully this will lead to a truce and to us becoming friends with the hunters of Hollowbrook."
    mct "Esperamos que isso leve a uma trégua e a nos tornarmos amigos dos caçadores de Hollowbrook."

# game/script7.rpy:4563
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_7b471f6f:

#   mc "Good."
    mc "Bom."

# game/script7.rpy:4567
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_1a334076:

#   mc "You should know that we passed through Hollowbrook on our way here, and I can tell you the hunters have lost all reason." with dis06
    mc "Você deveria saber que passamos por Hollowbrook a caminho daqui, e posso lhe dizer que os caçadores perderam toda a razão." with dis06

# game/script7.rpy:4568
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_b82e7221:

#   mc "They believe you're all malevolent creatures that must be eradicated."
    mc "Eles acreditam que todos vocês são criaturas malévolas que devem ser erradicadas."

# game/script7.rpy:4569
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_d46b9f1c:

#   mc "If you wish to help your brothers, you'd be better off far from that town of lunatics."
    mc "Se você deseja ajudar seus irmãos, seria melhor ficar longe daquela cidade de lunáticos."

# game/script7.rpy:4571
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_cabc1358:

#   fan "Thanks for the advice, we'll steer clear of it."
    fan "Obrigado pelo conselho, vamos evitar isso."

# game/script7.rpy:4572
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_3f5b1e20:

#   fan "It's not something we aren't used to by now. I understand that our appearance can be intimidating and instill fear."
    fan "Não é algo com o qual não estamos acostumados agora. Entendo que nossa aparência pode ser intimidante e inspirar medo."

# game/script7.rpy:4573
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_ea85e59e:

#   fan "Thanks again for your help, [mc]."
    fan "Obrigado novamente pela sua ajuda, [mc]."

# game/script7.rpy:4575
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_a7a92e8f:

#   mc "No problem."
    mc "Sem problemas."

# game/script7.rpy:4576
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_aa626dfe:

#   mc "And best of luck."
    mc "E boa sorte."

# game/script7.rpy:4578
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_b678f494:

#   l "Bye guys!" with dis15
    l "Tchau pessoal!" with dis15

# game/script7.rpy:4579
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_c83f463d:

#   l "Take care! It was so nice to meet you!"
    l "Tomar cuidado! Foi tão bom conhecer você!"

# game/script7.rpy:4580
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_cebe38cc:

#   bur "BYE LUNA!" with hpunch
    bur "Tchau, LUA!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:4581
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_e8d521c3:

#   duk "PLEASE PROMISE US YOU'LL VISIT!" with hpunch
    duk "POR FAVOR, PROMETE-NOS QUE VOCÊ VAI VISITA!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:4582
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_4dfd016b:

#   bur "AND TAKE CARE OUT THERE!" with hpunch
    bur "E CUIDADO AÍ!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:4583
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_6cc3308f:

#   duk "I'LL PREPARE A FLOWER BOUQUET FOR WHENEVER YOU'RE BACK!" with hpunch
    duk "PREPARAREI UM BOUQUET DE FLORES PARA QUANDO VOCÊ VOLTAR!" with hpunch

# game/script7.rpy:4584
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_8600b595:

#   l "I'll be looking forward to it!"
    l "Estarei ansioso por isso!"

# game/script7.rpy:4585
translate brazil postmenuwerewolf_60708219:

#   mc "*Chuckles* (I'll miss those guys.)"
    mc "*Risos* (Vou sentir falta desses caras.)"

# game/script7.rpy:4597
translate brazil poswerevamp_b03c3071:

#   mod "Choose which option will be the main one." nointeract
    mod "Escolha qual opção será a principal." nointeract

# game/script7.rpy:4617
translate brazil poswerevamp_3796a328:

#   mod "And would you like to see alternative scenes from other paths/allies when appropriate?" nointeract
    mod "E você gostaria de ver cenas alternativas de outros caminhos/aliados quando apropriado?" nointeract

# game/script7.rpy:4625
translate brazil poswerevamp_8d32f2ff:

#   mod "The following scene has variations depending on the animal you bought. Would you like to see them all here and in the future when possible?" nointeract
    mod "A cena a seguir tem variações dependendo do animal que você comprou. Você gostaria de ver todos eles aqui e no futuro, quando possível?" nointeract

# game/script7.rpy:4636
translate brazil poswerevamp_208f2304:

#   mc "*Sighs* Damn, that took waaaaay too long." with dis12
    mc "* Suspiros * Droga, isso demorou muito." with dis12

# game/script7.rpy:4638
translate brazil poswerevamp_8b97a27a:

#   mc "Penny is gonna think we're pushing up daisies."
    mc "Penny vai pensar que estamos plantando margaridas."

# game/script7.rpy:4640
translate brazil poswerevamp_804232bc:

#   mc "Luna is gonna think we're pushing up daisies."
    mc "Luna vai pensar que estamos plantando margaridas."

# game/script7.rpy:4643
translate brazil poswerevamp_c3175df9:

#   mc "And what's worse, it was all a huge waste of time." with dis15
    mc "E o que é pior, foi tudo uma enorme perda de tempo." with dis15

# game/script7.rpy:4644
translate brazil poswerevamp_66310bfe:

#   mc "It's obvious that those are not normal NPCs and they behave like real people, but we didn't learn anything about why or how they broke free of their rails."
    mc "É óbvio que esses não são NPCs normais e se comportam como pessoas reais, mas não aprendemos nada sobre por que ou como eles se libertaram dos trilhos."

# game/script7.rpy:4647
translate brazil poswerevamp_9df4c46d:

#   l "I don't think it was a waste of time!"
    l "Não acho que foi perda de tempo!"

# game/script7.rpy:4649
translate brazil poswerevamp_e27f4029:

#   l "We made new allies!"
    l "Fizemos novos aliados!"

# game/script7.rpy:4650
translate brazil poswerevamp_65359494:

#   l "I'm sure Fangrend, Duke, and Burpee would have our backs in the future if we ever needed them."
    l "Tenho certeza de que Fangrend, Duke e Burpee nos apoiariam no futuro se precisássemos deles."

# game/script7.rpy:4652
translate brazil poswerevamp_53342b27:

#   mc "Hmm, perhaps you're right."
    mc "Hmm, talvez você esteja certo."

# game/script7.rpy:4654
translate brazil poswerevamp_9244b149:

#   l "And even if not, we made new friends, at least."
    l "E mesmo que não, pelo menos fizemos novos amigos."

# game/script7.rpy:4656
translate brazil poswerevamp_9e4953d5:

#   mc "*Chuckles* I guess. I love how you always find the silver lining in every situation."
    mc "*Risos* Eu acho. Eu amo como você sempre encontra o lado positivo em todas as situações."

# game/script7.rpy:4658
translate brazil poswerevamp_2ab88c18:

#   l "Now let's meet up with Penny!"
    l "Agora vamos nos encontrar com Penny!"

# game/script7.rpy:4659
translate brazil poswerevamp_9ef8073a:

#   l "I'm curious to hear if she's actually found the vampires... and if they were as nice as the werewolves."
    l "Estou curioso para saber se ela realmente encontrou os vampiros... e se eles eram tão legais quanto os lobisomens."

# game/script7.rpy:4662
translate brazil poswerevamp_96fe5d1e:

#   p "I don't think it was a waste of time!"
    p "Não acho que foi perda de tempo!"

# game/script7.rpy:4664
translate brazil poswerevamp_1705422b:

#   p "We gained some new allies!"
    p "Ganhamos alguns novos aliados!"

# game/script7.rpy:4665
translate brazil poswerevamp_69d62e3f:

#   p "I'm sure Lord Iliescu and his wife would be willing to help us out in the future if we ever need it."
