translate brazil morninghollow_3d58850a:

#   mct "But, on the bright side, we've got some new powerful allies, I guess. Though their methods are somewhat... questionable."
    mct "Mas, pelo lado positivo, acho que temos alguns novos aliados poderosos. Embora seus métodos sejam um tanto... questionáveis."

# game/script7.rpy:6930
translate brazil morninghollow_47dadeeb:

#   mct "And I don’t know how welcome they’ll be on other servers."
